<title>UK: Lehman Holdings sets $250 million four-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Lehman Holdings sets $250 million four-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Lehman Brothers.</p>
<p> BORROWER   LEHMAN HOLDING PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  LEHMAN BROTHERS HOLDING INC</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 NOV.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     0.375     PAY DATE    06.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA1	ISS PRICE  99.731    FULL FEES   0.325</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A	   REOFFER    99.731</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.20	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF THE EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
